      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "2. The thread in row ty, column tx adds\n    up row ty of s_A times column tx of s_B.\n    Together, the threads add s_A · s_B to\n    the green tile.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. The thread in row ty, column tx adds\n    up row ty of s_A times column tx of s_B.\n    Together, the threads add s_A · s_B to\n    the green tile.",
